# Performance rules

## Defaults (do not regress)

- Two fonts only: Space Grotesk + IBM Plex Mono (`lib/fonts.js`).
- Keep the shell free of WebGL, boot screens, custom cursors, audio effects, and animation libraries.

## Before claiming "faster"

```sh
npm run perf:full
```

Compare `perf-reports/latest.json`: `routes[].performance`, `lcpMs`, `tbtMs`, `bundle.totalJsKb`.

## Red flags

- Importing heavy visual libraries in layout or provider.
- Route-enter horizontal slide animations.
- `backdrop-filter: blur()` on many simultaneous cards.
- `setState` on every `mousemove` without need.
